{"id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Axiom Set","display":"df-recursively-enumerable-theory — Recursively Enumerable Axiom Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","aliases":["67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory"],"display":"df-recursively-enumerable-theory — Recursively Enumerable Axiom Set","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-theory-closed]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"theory convention; Craig theorem","source_printed_pages":"5–6,10","source_pdf_pages":"16–17,21","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursively-enumerable-theory — Recursively Enumerable Axiom Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6062469a25ee5f89\" href=\"?note=6062469a25ee5f89\" title=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b59d5ff6e43660a9\" href=\"?note=b59d5ff6e43660a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"theory convention; Craig theorem"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"5–6,10"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"16–17,21"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是有效一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是固定有效 Gödel 编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是句子集合；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_1(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_1(X)\\)</span> 为自然数集合的递归可枚举性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b59d5ff6e43660a9\" href=\"?note=b59d5ff6e43660a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)\\)</span> 为固定一阶演算的定理集合，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6062469a25ee5f89\" href=\"?note=6062469a25ee5f89\" title=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Axbl}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Axbl}_L\\)</span> 是下式定义的编码集合构造及两个元语言谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\\mathrm{RE}_1(\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Axbl}_L(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (\\mathrm{REAx}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)=\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\\mathrm{RE}_1(\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Axbl}_L(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (\\mathrm{REAx}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)=\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 pp.5–6 将 theory 视为公理集合，p.10 以 Craig 定理允许换用原始递归公理集合。REAx 表示当前呈示可枚举，Axbl 表示存在演绎等价的可枚举呈示。旧式 T=Cn(A) 强迫 T 封闭，不能用于原书的公理集合 T。以后证明谓词均绑定选定呈示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-theory-closed","status":"resolved","id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-theory-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b59d5ff6e43660a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是有效一阶语言，$g$ 是固定有效 Gödel 编号，$T$ 是句子集合；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是有效一阶语言，$g$ 是固定有效 Gödel 编号，$T$ 是句子集合；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b59d5ff6e43660a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}_1(X)$ 为自然数集合的递归可枚举性，见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-theory-closed","status":"resolved","id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)$ 为固定一阶演算的定理集合，见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_1(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Axbl}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)&\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\\mathrm{RE}_1(\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Axbl}_L(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (\\mathrm{REAx}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)=\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2427,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 采用固定原始递归公理集呈现（从而 $\\mathrm{REAx}(T)$），$\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T$，$T\\nvdash\\bot$；$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 是公理集的递归可枚举性，见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]；$\\mathrm{PA}$ 见 [[67-df-PA]]。"},{"id":"fbd3170495a52979","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 采用 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]；$\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma$ 采用 [[67-df-partially-conservative]]。"},{"id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是有效一阶语言，固定有效 Gödel 编号 $g$，$T,U,X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]，$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，有限可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。"},{"id":"1b2d614db2eb3b87","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定自然有效句法编号 $g$，连接与句子识别可计算；$\\mathrm{Code}_g$ 沿用 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1$ 见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]。"},{"id":"0e0d50a09d6e5d48","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Complete}_L,\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-complete]]、[[67-df-decidable]]。"},{"id":"3034781c857fdfd7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示；$\\tau(z)\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A$ 是 $\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)$ 在 $T$ 中的双表示。其元语言谓词 $\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 及相关接口见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"45559b2e50b02071","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 是一元原始递归关系类，见 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。"},{"id":"b283932d44a857c0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示；$g$ 为本册固定句法编号，$\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)=\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]。"},{"id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6fca065df2bf5fac","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq Q$ 使用固定原始递归公理呈示、自然编号与标准证明公式；$\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-consistent]]。"},{"id":"589664f33390c7ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0485e18b7419ccd1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e972b0d757b4f3a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","e5654af7c954e1c0","6062469a25ee5f89","b59d5ff6e43660a9"]}